English (translation; the German text prevails)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The source code in this repository is publicly visible so that anyone can
check what Netzblick does and where data goes. This is not an open-source
licence.

You may:
  1. view and read the source code,
  2. install and use the versions published by geister-it (Google Play,
     releases of this repository),
  3. build the source code solely for your own private use in order to
     review it.

Without prior written permission from geister-it you may not:
  1. copy, modify, distribute or publish the source code or parts of it,
  2. distribute your own or modified versions, including in app stores,
     under another name or free of charge,
  3. use the source code commercially in any way.

The rights granted by GitHub's terms of service for public repositories
(viewing and forking on GitHub) remain unaffected; they do not permit any use
outside GitHub.

Versions up to and including 1.8.6 were published under the MIT licence and
remain available under it. This licence applies from version 1.8.7 on.

Third-party components (including Capacitor, Tauri, Apache ECharts and the
Barlow typeface) are subject to their own licences.

The software is provided without warranty, to the extent permitted by law.

Enquiries: patrick-schloegl@gmx.at
